<worksheet xml:id="functions">
    <title>Functions</title>
    <p>
        <alert>Definition:</alert> A <alert>function</alert> is a relationship with the condition that each input value is assigned to one and only one output value.   
    </p>
    <example workspace="0.5in">
        <p>
            Numerical representations of relationships are given below, determine if any of these relationships are functions.  
        </p>
            <sidebyside>
            <tabular halign="center">
                <row bottom="minor">
                    <cell right="minor">n</cell>
                    <cell>D</cell>
                </row>
                <row>
                    <cell right="minor">0</cell>
